('127.400.d.3.G',3,'Text blocks in CADD are useful for adding:','["units to a file", "power to a circuit", "layers to a printer", "notes and labels to a drawing"]'::jsonb,3,'Text provides annotation.','original'),
('127.400.d.3.G',4,'A revision note used again and again can be saved as a reusable:','["block", "grid", "hatch", "layer"]'::jsonb,0,'Reusable text is saved as a block.','original'),
